       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID.             SPMMODAT.
       ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
       CONFIGURATION SECTION.
       SOURCE-COMPUTER.        IBM-AS400.
       OBJECT-COMPUTER.        IBM-AS400.

       INPUT-OUTPUT SECTION.
       FILE-CONTROL.
           SELECT PM-SCHEDULE
                  ASSIGN       TO DATABASE-MCFLMM4402
                  ORGANIZATION IS INDEXED
                  ACCESS MODE  IS DYNAMIC
                  RECORD KEY   IS EXTERNALLY-DESCRIBED-KEY
                               WITH DUPLICATES
                  FILE STATUS  IS FILE-STAT.

       DATA DIVISION.
       FILE SECTION.
       FD  PM-SCHEDULE
           LABEL RECORDS ARE STANDARD.
       01  PM-SCHED-REC.
           COPY DDS-ALL-FORMATS OF MCFLMM4402.

       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01  FILE-STAT.
           05 FILE-STAT-1      PIC X   VALUE "0".
           05 FILE-STAT-2      PIC X   VALUE "0".


       COPY SCREENIO           IN COPYLIB.

       01  PM-SCHED-DATA.
           COPY DPMSCHED       IN COPYLIB.

       LINKAGE SECTION.
           COPY DAYTABLE       IN COPYLIB.

       01  LINK-DATA.
           05 LINK-EQUIP       PIC X(06).
           05 LINK-WONUM       PIC X(10).
           05 LINK-ZONE-PRI    PIC X(06).
           05 LINK-YRMO.
               10 LINK-DATA-X.
                   15  LD-YEAR     PIC X(04).
                   15  LD-MONTH    PIC X(02).
               10 LINK-DATA-9      REDEFINES LINK-DATA-X.
                   15  LD-YR       PIC 9(04).
                   15  LD-YRB      REDEFINES LD-YR.
                       20  LDYR3   PIC 9(03).
                       20  LDYRL   PIC 9.
                   15  LD-MON      PIC 9(02).

       01  DBPARAMETERS.
           COPY DBPARMS        IN COPYLIB.

       01  ERROR-MESSAGE.
           05  ERROR-TEXT      PIC X(70).
           05  ERROR-FILL      PIC X(06).
           05  ERROR-CODE      REDEFINES ERROR-FILL PIC 9(06).

       PROCEDURE DIVISION      USING DAY-TABLE-DATA
                               LINK-DATA
                               DBPARAMETERS
                               ERROR-MESSAGE.

       OPEN-FILES.
           OPEN INPUT          PM-SCHEDULE.

       START-PROCESSING.
           MOVE LINK-YRMO      TO PMRLSEYRMO.
           PERFORM DBFIND-LOOP THRU DBF-EXIT.
           GO TO END-OF-JOB.

       DBFIND-LOOP.

           START PM-SCHEDULE   KEY = PMRLSEYRMO OF PM-SCHEDULE
               INVALID KEY     MOVE FILE-STAT TO FILE-STAT.
           IF FILE-STAT NOT = "00"
               GO TO END-OF-JOB.

       DBGET-LOOP.
           READ PM-SCHEDULE    NEXT INTO PM-SCHED-DATA
               AT END          MOVE FILE-STAT TO FILE-STAT.
           IF FILE-STAT = "10" OR "14" OR "46"
             GO TO DBF-EXIT
           ELSE
             IF FILE-STAT NOT = "00"
               MOVE FILE-STAT  TO ERROR-CODE
               MOVE "DBGET ERROR - RECORDS NOT FOUND"
                               TO ERROR-TEXT
               GO TO END-OF-JOB.

           IF SCH-RELEASE-YRMO NOT = LINK-YRMO
               GO TO DBF-EXIT.

           IF SCH-EQUIP-NUM NOT = LINK-EQUIP
               GO TO DBGET-LOOP.

           IF SCH-WO-NUM NOT = LINK-WONUM
               GO TO DBGET-LOOP.

           IF SCH-REC-TYPE = "CL  "
               MOVE PM-SCHED-DATA TO DAY-DATA(SCH-REL-DAY).

           GO TO DBGET-LOOP.

       DBF-EXIT.               EXIT.

       END-OF-JOB.
           CLOSE               PM-SCHEDULE.
           GOBACK.

      ******************  END OF FILE - SPMMODAT  *******************
